    ('real eight: ClearHost clears the dialogues of the title only', 'Sources/azl/dlp_real_net.cpp', 'for (u32 s = 0; s < kRealClients; ++s) {  // (the whole table, whatever the title uses of it)', 'for (u32 s = 0; s < kRealClients && s + 1 < players_; ++s) {'),
