    ('real eight: Members lists the nodes of the table whatever the title', 'Sources/azl/dlp_real_net.cpp', 'for (u32 id = 1; id <= 16 && count < players_; ++id) {', 'for (u32 id = 1; id <= 16 && count < kRealPlayers; ++id) {'),
