    ('real eight: a packet is taken from a node of the table whatever the title', 'Sources/azl/dlp_real_net.cpp', 'src < kFirstClientNode || src > players_) {', 'src < kFirstClientNode || src > kRealPlayers) {'),
    ('real eight: a bound of the real Download Play is a number', 'Sources/azl/dlp_real_net.cpp', 'src < kFirstClientNode || src > players_) {', 'src < kFirstClientNode || src > 4) {'),
    ('real eight: the Pump steps three dialogues', 'Sources/azl/dlp_real_net.cpp', '    TakePackets(now);\n    for (u32 s = 0; s < kRealClients && s + 1 < players_; ++s) {\n        const u32 node = s + kFirstClientNode;', '    TakePackets(now);\n    for (u32 s = 0; s < 3; ++s) {\n        const u32 node = s + kFirstClientNode;'),
